<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the 21.7</p>
<p>kilometre time trial fifth stage of Tour of Romandie on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Chris Boardman (Britain) 24 minutes 10 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Viatcheslav Ekimov (Russia)     16 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Erik Breukink (Netherlands)     36</p>
